  "description": "After breaking up with his cheating ex, Woo-kyung decides to start over. On the first day in his new apartment, his next-door neighbor Jin-woo—who happens to look exactly like his ex—makes an unexpected offer.\n\n*“Do you hate me because I look like him?”*\n\nHe swore off relationships for good, but...\n\n*“When you came into my place, didn’t you expect this to happen?”*\n\nWoo-kyung finds himself swayed by Jin-woo’s temptation.\nMeanwhile, his college friend Hyun-soo warns him to stay away from Jin-woo, leaving Woo-kyung torn between two men he isn’t sure he can trust.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000051615), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9986380)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3372)",
